          "text": "Work-related stress and emotional symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports increased work stress over the past few weeks due to short staffing, double shifts, and night shifts; feels on edge and tearful after shifts, cancels social plans, worries about work performance and fears a medication error due to fatigue, and is irritable at home. Feels demoralised about the job but says life overall is “ok.” No clear anhedonia."
      }
    },
