        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Chest tightness mainly before shifts or in bed, lasting 5–10 minutes and settling with slow breathing. No exertional chest pain, shortness of breath, syncope, nausea, vomiting, or diaphoresis."
